  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Glorious Arena</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Alteration sphere (Vermin Transformation (transformation)) or web bestial trait; poison bestial trait or racial poison ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Any target which becomes entangled by your web is exposed to the poison granted by your bestial trait, shapeshift, or other features that grant you a poison. They are exposed an additional time whenever they fail a check to escape your web.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alteration#toc96\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
